exports[`git.pull.watch, via rhachet given: [case1] a repo with the mechanic role linked when: [t5] del stops a watch a clone holds, then finds none then: plan names the watch, writes naught, and names the apply 1`] = `
"🐢 heres the wave...

🐚 git.pull.watch del --mode plan
   ├─ pr: ehmpathy/surf-demo#1240
   ├─ daemon: v1.0.0+cafe0003
   └─ verdict: would delete

🥥 did you know?
   └─ plan writes naught; to stop the watch
      └─ rhx git.pull.watch del --pull 1240 --in ehmpathy/surf-demo --mode apply
"
`;

